    "Cost": 970562,
    "UIName": "Hermes III",
    "Id": "chassisdef_hermes_iii_HER-7K",
    "Name": "Hermes III",
    "Details": "The Hermes III HER-7K is the latests upgrade of the Hermes III by Luthien Armor Works, introducing all the hottest new tech into the design. Combining a Angel ECM and a Bloodhound probe provides excellent electronic warfare capabilities, while a Supercharger replaces the Jump Jets of earlier variants for improved bursts of speed. It's weapons are two clan tech Extended Range Large Lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.02</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_HermesII"
  },
  "VariantName": "HER-7K",
  "ChassisTags": {
    "items": []
  },
  "StockRole": "Scout",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Hermes III was created by Ostmann Industries by taking a Hermes II HER-2S and adapting it to the available technology in the Draconis Combine at that time. Its main goal was to act as a smaller companion to the Ostsol line, retaining the scouting and light skirmisher role of the original Hermes and Hermes II. As the demand for more upgraded mechs in these roles started growing, Luthien Armor Works upgraded a number of ageing first generation Hermes III to modern standards.",
